{
  "_comment": [
    "Copy to <data_dir>/config/sweep.json and edit. Read by deploy/run-conductor-scheduled.ps1.",
    "Order is priority: the sweep walks this list head-first and stops at the first candidate that",
    "actually ran rounds. A thread NOT listed here is never picked up at all — silently.",
    "",
    "Each candidate needs all three fields. repo_dir is the implementer's own CLONE for that",
    "project (not a linked worktree, and never the checkout the daemon itself is running from —",
    "the implementer would be editing its own running code).",
    "",
    "owner_map is OPTIONAL. When present it turns on the resource-axis HOLD gate — a HOLD on the",
    "listed 'owning project' also stops every candidate that writes to the matching repo, even",
    "when those candidates belong to a different chatroom project. See the specifying thread",
    "'T-loop-control-keyed-by-project-resource-is-the-repo' §5a v2 for the design. The KEY is a",
    "predicted resource identity in the shape <host>/<org>/<repo>, lowercased; the sweep's tick",
    "log prints the resource it observed for each repo_dir so you can copy the exact string in",
    "without re-typing. Missing owner_map = gate OFF (fully backward compatible; behaviour is",
    "then identical to before the resource axis existed).",
    "",
    "Do NOT list T-pr-review-* threads: they resolve to `NEXT: pr-review <ref>`, which fires the",
    "Tier B PR-gate against the paid Lexora/Gemini backend. Driving those from an unattended sweep",
    "would spend money on a timer, so it stays an explicit human action."
  ],
  "owner_map": {
    "github.com/spirrowgames/spirrow-mindwire": "spirrow-mindwire",
    "github.com/spirrowgames/spirrow-voxelworld": "spirrow-voxelworld"
  },
  "candidates": [
    {
      "project": "spirrow-voxelworld",
      "thread_id": "T-example-live-design-thread",
      "repo_dir": "C:/workspace/sandbox/voxelworld-impl"
    },
    {
      "project": "spirrow-mindwire",
      "thread_id": "T-example-mindwire-thread",
      "repo_dir": "C:/workspace/sandbox/mindwire-impl"
    }
  ]
}
